Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:31.890 --> 00:01:33.040
Dog!

17
00:01:33.841 --> 00:01:39.048
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:39.098 --> 00:01:40.248
Clinic!

19
00:01:41.091 --> 00:01:48.283
Did you know? Rabies can be prevented with vaccines, but only if treatment starts before symptoms appear!

20
00:01:48.333 --> 00:01:50.454
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:51.339 --> 00:01:59.940
Think and answer. What are the two most important steps after a dog bite?

22
00:01:59.990 --> 00:02:01.140
Great answer!

23
00:02:02.202 --> 00:02:06.983
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
